#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:2
msgid "Customize your Desktop App experience"
msgstr "데스크톱 앱 환경 사용자 지정"

#: ../../source/_static/badges/all-commercial.rst:7
msgid ""
"|plans-img-yellow| Available on `Entry, Professional, Enterprise, and "
"Enterprise Advanced plans <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__"
msgstr ""
"|plans-img-yellow| `Entry, Professional, Enterprise 및 Enterprise Advanced "
"플랜 <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__\\ 에서 사용할 수 있습니다"

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:6
msgid "plans-img-yellow"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:7
msgid ""
"You can customize your desktop app further with additional settings. "
"Select the tab below that matches your operating system to learn more "
"about what's available."
msgstr ""
"추가 설정으로 데스크톱 앱을 더 사용자 지정할 수 있습니다. 사용 가능한 옵션에 "
"대해 자세히 알아보려면 운영 체제에 맞는 아래 탭을 선택하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:12
msgid ""
"With the Mattermost desktop app in focus, select **Mattermost > "
"Settings...**"
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST 데스크톱 앱이 활성화된 상태에서 **Mattermost > Settings...**\\ 를 "
"선택합니다"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:14
msgid ""
"Access Desktop App customization settings by selecting Mattermost from "
"the menu bar, then selecting Preferences."
msgstr ""
"메뉴 모음에서 Mattermost를 선택한 다음 Preferences를 선택해 데스크톱 앱 "
"커스터마이징 설정에 접근합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:18
#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:67
msgid "General"
msgstr "일반"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:20
#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:69
msgid ""
"**Download Location**: Specify where on your machine you want files to be"
" downloaded from the desktop app."
msgstr ""
"**Download Location**: 데스크톱 앱에서 파일을 컴퓨터의 어디에 다운로드할지 "
"지정합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:21
msgid ""
"**Show icon in the notification area**: The Mattermost icon displays in "
"the notification area. You can hide this icon if preferred. Restart the "
"desktop app to apply changes to this setting."
msgstr ""
"**Show icon in the notification area**: 알림 영역에 OKR.BEST 아이콘이 "
"표시됩니다. 원하면 이 아이콘을 숨길 수 있습니다. 이 설정의 변경 사항을 "
"적용하려면 데스크톱 앱을 다시 시작하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:22
#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:75
msgid ""
"**Synchronize Desktop App theme with server**: The desktop app theme "
"automatically matches the theme set on your primary Mattermost server. "
"Disable this setting to manage desktop app themes independently."
msgstr ""
"**Synchronize Desktop App theme with server**: 데스크톱 앱 테마가 기본 "
"OKR.BEST 서버에 설정된 테마와 자동으로 일치합니다. 데스크톱 앱 테마를 별도로 "
"관리하려면 이 설정을 비활성화하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:23
#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:74
msgid ""
"**Open app in full screen**: Configure the desktop app to open in "
"fullscreen. Disable this setting to open the app in a windowed view."
msgstr ""
"**Open app in full screen**: 데스크톱 앱이 전체 화면으로 열리도록 구성합니다. "
"창 보기로 앱을 열려면 이 설정을 비활성화하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:24
#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:76
msgid ""
"**Maximum number of open views**: From Desktop v6.0, set the maximum "
"number of open tabs and windows per workspace. When a limit is set, "
"Mattermost prompts you to close tabs or windows when the limit is "
"exceeded. Leave this field blank for no maximum limit."
msgstr ""
"**Maximum number of open views**: 데스크톱 v6.0부터 워크스페이스별로 열린 "
"탭과 창의 최대 개수를 설정합니다. 제한을 설정하면 한도를 초과할 때 OKR.BEST가 "
"탭이나 창을 닫으라는 안내를 표시합니다. 최대 제한을 두지 않으려면 이 필드를 "
"비워 두세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:27
#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:80
msgid "Notifications"
msgstr "알림"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:29
msgid ""
"**Show red badge on Dock icon to indicate unread messages**: A red badge "
"on the Dock icon displays a count of unread messages and mentions. You "
"can configure the desktop app to display a count of mentions only, if "
"preferred."
msgstr ""
"**Show red badge on Dock icon to indicate unread messages**: Dock 아이콘의 "
"빨간색 배지가 읽지 않은 메시지와 멘션 수를 표시합니다. 원하면 데스크톱 앱이 "
"멘션 수만 표시하도록 구성할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:30
msgid ""
"**Bounce the Dock icon**: When a new message is received on any of your "
"active teams and servers, the Dock icon bounces once or bounces until you"
" open the desktop app. You can configure the Mattermost Desktop App Dock "
"icon to bounce more, less, or not at all."
msgstr ""
"**Bounce the Dock icon**: 활성 팀과 서버 중 하나에서 새 메시지를 받으면 Dock "
"아이콘이 한 번 튀거나 데스크톱 앱을 열 때까지 계속 튑니다. OKR.BEST 데스크톱 "
"앱 Dock 아이콘이 더 많이, 더 적게, 또는 전혀 튀지 않도록 구성할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:33
#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:86
msgid "Language"
msgstr "언어"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:35
#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:88
msgid "**App Language**: Specify your preferred language for the desktop app."
msgstr "**App Language**: 데스크톱 앱에 사용할 선호 언어를 지정합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:36
#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:89
msgid ""
"**Check spelling**: Misspelled words detected in your messages are "
"highlighted based on your app language preference. You can disable spell "
"check if preferred."
msgstr ""
"**Check spelling**: 메시지에서 감지된 철자 오류 단어가 앱 언어 설정을 기준으로 "
"강조 표시됩니다. 원하면 맞춤법 검사를 비활성화할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:38
msgid ""
"**Spell Checker Languages**: Specify additional spell check languages if "
"needed. Restart the desktop app to change this setting. When multiple "
"languages are configured:"
msgstr ""
"**Spell Checker Languages**: 필요하면 추가 맞춤법 검사 언어를 지정합니다. 이 "
"설정을 변경하려면 데스크톱 앱을 다시 시작하세요. 여러 언어가 구성된 경우:"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:40
#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:92
msgid ""
"All selected languages show as spelled correctly when a word matches at "
"least one selected language"
msgstr ""
"단어가 선택된 언어 중 하나 이상과 일치하면 선택된 모든 언어에서 철자가 올바른 "
"것으로 표시됩니다"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:41
#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:93
msgid ""
"All selected languages show as spelled incorrectly when a word matches "
"none of the selected languages."
msgstr ""
"단어가 선택된 언어 중 어느 것과도 일치하지 않으면 선택된 모든 언어에서 철자가 "
"틀린 것으로 표시됩니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:43
#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:95
msgid ""
"**Use an alternative dictionary URL**: Specify an alternate dictionary "
"for spell check as a site URL."
msgstr ""
"**Use an alternative dictionary URL**: 맞춤법 검사용 대체 사전을 사이트 URL로 "
"지정합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:46
#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:98
msgid "Servers"
msgstr "서버"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:48
#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:100
msgid ""
"**Add and manage server connections**: Learn more about :doc:`connecting "
"your desktop app to multiple Mattermost workspaces </end-user-"
"guide/preferences/connect-multiple-workspaces>`."
msgstr ""
"**Add and manage server connections**: :doc:`데스크톱 앱을 여러 OKR.BEST "
"워크스페이스에 연결 </end-user-guide/preferences/connect-multiple-"
"workspaces>`\\ 하는 방법을 알아보세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:51
#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:103
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "고급"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:53
#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:105
msgid ""
"**Logging level**: Adjust logging levels to isolate and troubleshoot "
"issues. Increasing the log level increases disk space usage and can "
"impact performance."
msgstr ""
"**Logging level**: 문제를 격리하고 해결하기 위해 로그 수준을 조정합니다. 로그 "
"수준을 높이면 디스크 공간 사용량이 늘어나고 성능에 영향을 줄 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:54
#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:106
msgid ""
"**Send anonymous usage data to your configured servers**: Send desktop "
"app usage and performance data to your configured Mattermost servers set "
"up to accept it."
msgstr ""
"**Send anonymous usage data to your configured servers**: 데스크톱 앱 사용 및 "
"성능 데이터를 이를 수신하도록 설정된 구성된 OKR.BEST 서버로 보냅니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:55
#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:107
msgid ""
"**Send error reports to help improve the app**: From Mattermost Desktop "
"v6.1.0, error reports and crash information are automatically sent to "
"Sentry (a third-party error tracking service) to help identify and fix "
"issues. This setting is enabled by default. Error reports include crash "
"information, app version, and platform details (OS, architecture, memory "
"stats), but no personally identifiable information (PII) is included. You"
" can disable error reporting if preferred. Restart the desktop app to "
"apply changes to this setting."
msgstr ""
"**Send error reports to help improve the app**: OKR.BEST 데스크톱 v6.1.0부터, "
"문제를 식별하고 수정하는 데 도움이 되도록 오류 보고서와 크래시 정보가 "
"Sentry(서드파티 오류 추적 서비스)로 자동 전송됩니다. 이 설정은 기본적으로 "
"활성화되어 있습니다. 오류 보고서에는 크래시 정보, 앱 버전, 플랫폼 "
"세부 정보(OS, 아키텍처, 메모리 통계)가 포함되지만 개인 식별 정보(PII)는 "
"포함되지 않습니다. 원하면 오류 보고를 비활성화할 수 있습니다. 이 설정의 변경 "
"사항을 적용하려면 데스크톱 앱을 다시 시작하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:56
#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:108
msgid ""
"**Use GPU hardware acceleration**: GPU hardware acceleration renders the "
"desktop app interface more efficiently. If you encounter decreased "
"stability, disable GPU hardware acceleration. Restart the desktop app to "
"apply changes to this setting."
msgstr ""
"**Use GPU hardware acceleration**: GPU 하드웨어 가속은 데스크톱 앱 화면을 더 "
"효율적으로 렌더링합니다. 안정성이 떨어지면 GPU 하드웨어 가속을 비활성화하세요. "
"이 설정의 변경 사항을 적용하려면 데스크톱 앱을 다시 시작하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:61
msgid ""
"With the Mattermost desktop app in focus, select the **More** |more-icon-"
"vertical| icon in the top left of the menu bar and select **File > "
"Settings...**"
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST 데스크톱 앱이 활성화된 상태에서 메뉴 모음 왼쪽 위의 **More** |more-"
"icon-vertical| 아이콘을 선택하고 **File > Settings...**\\ 를 선택합니다"

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:50
msgid ""
"Use the More icon in the top left corner to access Mattermost desktop "
"apps customization settings."
msgstr ""
"왼쪽 위의 더 보기 아이콘을 사용해 OKR.BEST 데스크톱 앱 커스터마이징 설정에 "
"접근합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:63
msgid ""
"Access Desktop App customization settings by selecting More in the top "
"left corner, then selecting File > Settings."
msgstr ""
"왼쪽 위 모서리에서 More를 선택한 다음 File > Settings를 선택해 데스크톱 앱 "
"커스터마이징 설정에 접근합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:70
msgid ""
"**Start app on login**: The desktop app starts up automatically when you "
"log in to your machine. You can disable this if preferred."
msgstr ""
"**Start app on login**: 컴퓨터에 로그인하면 데스크톱 앱이 자동으로 시작됩니다. "
"원하면 이를 비활성화할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:71
msgid ""
"**Launch app minimized**: Configure the desktop app to launch minimized "
"in the system tray."
msgstr ""
"**Launch app minimized**: 데스크톱 앱이 시스템 트레이에 최소화된 상태로 "
"실행되도록 구성합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:72
msgid ""
"**Icon color**: Display a light, dark, or system default-driven "
"Mattermost icon."
msgstr ""
"**Icon color**: 밝은색, 어두운색 또는 시스템 기본값을 따르는 OKR.BEST 아이콘을 "
"표시합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:73
msgid ""
"**Leave app running in notification area when application window is "
"closed**: When closing the desktop app, you’re prompted to confirm "
"whether you want to permanently close the app. Disable this confirmation "
"by selecting **Don’t ask again**. Silence these notifications by "
"selecting **Don’t show again**. Restart the desktop app to apply changes "
"to this setting."
msgstr ""
"**Leave app running in notification area when application window is "
"closed**: 데스크톱 앱을 닫을 때 앱을 완전히 닫을지 확인하라는 안내가 "
"표시됩니다. **Don't ask again**\\ 을 선택해 이 확인을 비활성화하세요. **Don't "
"show again**\\ 을 선택해 이러한 알림을 끄세요. 이 설정의 변경 사항을 적용하려면 "
"데스크톱 앱을 다시 시작하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:77
msgid ""
"**Use native title bar** (Linux only): From Mattermost Desktop v6.2.0, "
"render the desktop app with your Linux desktop environment's native title"
" bar and window controls instead of the custom Mattermost title bar. "
"Restart the desktop app to apply changes to this setting."
msgstr ""
"**Use native title bar**(Linux 전용): OKR.BEST 데스크톱 v6.2.0부터, 사용자 "
"지정 OKR.BEST 제목 표시줄 대신 Linux 데스크톱 환경의 기본 제목 표시줄과 창 "
"컨트롤로 데스크톱 앱을 렌더링합니다. 이 설정의 변경 사항을 적용하려면 데스크톱 "
"앱을 다시 시작하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:82
msgid "**Show red badge on taskbar icon to indicate unread messages**:"
msgstr "**Show red badge on taskbar icon to indicate unread messages**:"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:83
msgid ""
"**Flash taskbar icon when a new message is received**: Your desktop app "
"taskbar icon flashes when a new message is received on any of your active"
" teams and servers. You can disable the flashing taskbar icon if "
"preferred."
msgstr ""
"**Flash taskbar icon when a new message is received**: 활성 팀과 서버 중 "
"하나에서 새 메시지를 받으면 데스크톱 앱 작업 표시줄 아이콘이 깜박입니다. 원하면 "
"작업 표시줄 아이콘 깜박임을 비활성화할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience.rst:90
msgid ""
"**Spell Checker Languages**: Specify additional spell check languages if "
"needed. Restart the desktop app to apply changes to this setting. When "
"multiple languages are configured:"
msgstr ""
"**Spell Checker Languages**: 필요하면 추가 맞춤법 검사 언어를 지정합니다. 이 "
"설정의 변경 사항을 적용하려면 데스크톱 앱을 다시 시작하세요. 여러 언어가 구성된 "
"경우:"

